  "description": "Quick Position Update, What I'm Expecting In The Markets and Dashboard Overview",
  "body_html": "<p>One stock just absolutely <em><strong>REFUSES</strong></em> to go down for us, up over 49% thus far…ill get to that momentarily…</p><p><strong>Overall market expectations</strong>: even with the fear of Tariffs being re-implemented 🙄 (again) and the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/interest-rates-what-poison-do-you?r=4z8lgl\">Interest Rate Feud between Trump and Jerome Powell</a> which we covered today…the <em><strong>stock market is not giving any signals to NOT be in investing or trading</strong></em>. Though my long term (more than a year) forecast remains relatively bearish (sorry!)…we do not know when or even if that will come. What we do know, is that several select names and the overall indexes like the S&amp;P 500 continue to trend upwards. Trend is your friend…go with it until price action says otherwise. 📈</p><p><strong>StockTok Dashboard Overview:</strong>  The <a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTok Dashboard</a> is complete. Apologies for my tunnel vision last week building this. But its turned out super cool, and simple to use. My positions, the screener results, major economic events and upcoming earnings are all integrated. Screener results are updated everyday after market close. If you have questions, first check the FAQ linked at the bottom of the page. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pWc3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcca90cf9-723f-47e0-b2ea-46473e9badbf_1799x891.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pWc3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcca90cf9-723f-47e0-b2ea-46473e9badbf_1799x891.pn